big-code-analysis-book/book
.git
tests/repositories
node_modules
**/node_modules
big-code-analysis-py/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.so
out
dist
.serena
.mcp.json
